  "explanation": "<h3>Capacity under the 80% income limit</h3><p>80% × $250,000 = $200,000.</p><h3>Allowed NOL deduction after both limits</h3><p>The $120,000 ownership-change limit is the lower applicable capacity.</p><h3>Remaining NOL carryforward</h3><p>$300,000 − $120,000 = $180,000.</p><h3>Tax before credits after NOL deduction</h3><p>($250,000 − $120,000) × 21% = $27,300.</p>"
